'''''I Shall Turn the Tide''''' is a [[Trailblaze Continuance]] in the chapter [[Finest Duel Under the Pristine Blue (II)]].

==Steps==
# Check the state of security aboard the Skysplitter
# Seek information from the Cloud Knights
# (Optional) Check up on March 7th
# Inspect the suspicious starskiff
# Search the engine room and discover the cause of the malfunction
# Hurry to the Wardance arena and stop the borisin's attack
# Witness the two generals' conversation

