===Seek information from the Cloud Knights{{subst:void|<!--202230304-->}}===
{{Dialogue Start}}

;(Talk to Soldier on Duty)
:{{tx}}
:'''Soldier on Duty:''' Is that you, Miss Yunli? If there is anything that I can help you with, please let me know.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} How are the Cloud Knights doing?
::'''Soldier on Duty:''' The Cloud Knights are all in position, following General Huaiyan's orders.
::Have you noticed any "wolves"?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Have you noticed any "wolves"?
:'''Soldier on Duty:''' We haven't noticed anything out of the ordinary yet.
:'''Yunli:''' Very good. Although, there is one thing I want to confirm with you...
:{{tx}}
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} Do you have a way of identifying borisin?
::'''Soldier on Duty:''' Unfortunately, we don't have any means to distinguish between borisin and foxians.
::{{tx}}
:;(Return to previous option selection)
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} Tell me about how the Cloud Knights are currently deployed.
::'''Soldier on Duty:''' All Cloud Knights on the Skysplitter have their own responsibilities and wouldn't dare neglect their posts.
::{{tx}}
:;(Return to previous option selection)
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I would like to confirm if there have been any irregularities in boarding.
::'''Soldier on Duty:''' Your timing is perfect, Miss Yunli. We actually just received an emergency boarding request.
::{{tx}}
::{{tx}}

:{{DIcon|Изучение}} Investigate
:'''Yunli:''' It took enough time to calm her nerves, it's best I don't disturb her again now.
:'''Yunli:''' Maybe I should take a moment to meet with March before the tournament starts?
:'''Yunli:''' March is in the contestant's lounge right now. I wonder how her preparations are coming along...
{{Dialogue End}}

===(Optional) Check up on March 7th{{subst:void|<!--202230308-->}}===
{{Dialogue Start}}

:{{DIcon|Изучение}} Investigate
:'''Yunli:''' March, it's me, Yunli. Are you okay?
:'''March 7th:''' Aghhhhhhhh...!
:'''March 7th:''' Ooh, ow-ow-owww. Just a moment, I'm coming!
:'''Yunli:''' Ah... She's still a nervous wreck.
:'''Yunli:''' You still seem nervous.
:'''March 7th:''' I wasn't this nervous before... It's just being alone in this lounge, I can't stop thinking about everything. I mean, not only are we taking part in the Wardance, but we have such an important mission to carry out as well...
:'''Yunli:''' March, calm down.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Don't worry about your mission. I am here to help you.
:'''Yunli:''' Don't worry about your mission. You have me here too, right? I know my grandfather said that you must "represent the Luofu as the ringmaster," but don't let that intimidate you.
:{{tx}}
:{{tx}}
{{Dialogue End}}

===Inspect the suspicious starskiff{{subst:void|<!--202230302-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=continuance|location=Skysplitter|update|Aboard the Skysplitter, the tense atmosphere and anxiety from waiting are starting to make Yunli uneasy. She decides to conduct a thorough patrol of the Skysplitter before the tournament begins to ensure that nothing untoward is happening.<br />The late arrival of a starskiff arouses Yunli's wariness.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}
;(По прибытии на место)

;(По прибытии на место)
:'''Yunli:''' Routine inspection! All passengers please prepare for an inspection.
:'''Yunli:''' (So, this is the suspicious starskiff? Where did the passengers go...?)
:'''Yunli:''' I'm going to count down from ten. If you do not come out, I will destroy the ship.
:'''Yunli:''' Ten!
:'''Yunli:''' Nine, eight, seven, six, five, four... Time is running out!
:'''Yunli:''' Three! Two!
:'''Yunli:''' One!
:'''???:''' Wait a second!
:'''Yanqing:''' It's me.
:'''Yanqing:''' It's just a routine inspection. You weren't actually going to blow up the ship, were you? Is that also some kind of Zhuming custom...?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} What are you doing back here!?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} You're not a borisin in disguise, are you?
::'''Yanqing:''' Wait! Even though the borisin can disguise themselves, they can't turn into someone as short as me! Put your sword away.
:'''Yunli:''' Didn't little Yanqing claim he was going to give up being the ringmaster and go on the hunt instead? Help shoulder the general's burdens?
:{{tx}}

:{{DIcon|Изучение}} Investigate
:'''Yunli:''' It took enough time to calm her nerves, it's best I don't disturb her again now.
:'''Yunli:''' According to Grandpa's plan, I should seek out the Cloud Knight soldiers aboard the Skysplitter and see if there've been any new developments...
:'''Yunli:''' (I have to check on this immediately.)
{{Dialogue End}}

